WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:08.720
I haven't seen enough of him to know that he could actually perform at this level.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.360
Come on, son.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.600
Boys, jog in.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:18.000
I want you to make the new lad feel welcome,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.880
he might even make a few of you look good.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.720
I don’t know why you signed with us.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.840
You’re not coming near the first team.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.200
Don’t worry about it mate, welcome.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.400
Show me what you’ve got...

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.800
and I’ll be thinking about you for the first team at the weekend.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.240
It’s up to you.

